        { title: "Verify exactness of multiplied ODE", math: t`y^2\,dx + (2xy - y^2 e^y)\,dy = 0 \implies \frac{\partial}{\partial y}(y^2) = 2y = \frac{\partial}{\partial x}(2xy - y^2 e^y) = 2y \quad \checkmark` }
