    difficulty: "Exam Master",
    question: t`What is the planar density of the $(110)$ plane in BCC, in terms of $R$?`,
    options: [t`$\dfrac{3}{8\sqrt2\,R^{2}}$`, t`$\dfrac{1}{4\sqrt2\,R^{2}}$`, t`$\dfrac{3}{16\sqrt2\,R^{2}}$`, t`$\dfrac{1}{2\sqrt2\,R^{2}}$`],
